rst page p95：2 ms / 750 ms\n- ACK p95：15 ms / 150 ms\n- replay recovery：46 ms / 2,000 ms\n- RSS：1,103,204,352 bytes / 2 GiB\n- post-GC growth：-2,472 bytes / 5%\n\n终态：`STAGE6_PERFORMANCE_OK`\n\n### 发布与回归验证\n\n- 最终签名 Host 安装、升级、配对通过。\n- pre-migration backup 已实际生成。\n- 签名 failed-health candidate 返回预期 exit 6，随后真实恢复最终健康版本。\n- Gradle 外部 BOM consumer 通过。\n- Maven 3.9.11 / Java 21 在线和离线 consumer 均通过。\n- 最终干净 Maven repository：1,465 个文件。\n- 最终发布 artifact：1,475 个文件。\n- SBOM：592 个锁定依赖。\n- 1,475 个 provenance subjects 和 1,475 个验证过的签名。\n- Stage 6 最终 Java/CLI/Remote 回归：111 tasks 全部通过。\n- generated contracts：92 files reproducible。\n- stage-gate contracts：11/11。\n- Stage 0–5 回归、Web、Playwright、ACP、acpx、Gold-Band、Ubuntu Compose 和 Remote topology 均通过。\n- Gradle daemon 及本轮 JI-owned 临时资源已清理。\n- working tree clean。\n\n完整证据汇总：\n\n`/export/user\\.gold-band\\projects\\e-projects-code-ai-ji--a40d4379\\tasks\\task-015\\runs\\run-001\\rounds\\round-001\\nodes\\ai-dynamic\\attempt-001\\dynamic\\nodes\\phase-6-finish-after-capacity-blocker\\attempt-001\\attachments\\verification-summary.md`\n\n### 本地提交\n\n```text\n5f44847308d8a2f4f52d0811315e1fc3e68af65a\nfeat(java-rewrite): complete stage 6 release hardening\n```\n\n提交包含精确 footer：\n\n```text\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n```\n\n未 push，未创建 PR。移动真机、独立 Relay 安全评审及 registered-client OAuth 继续如实保留为 `FOLLOW_UP`。"},{"id":"acp-event-10936","kind":"sessionInfo","title":"用户已选择将当前节点重新交由 Runtime 控制。当前输出契约（如有）重新生效。","sessionId":"68e1f968-54b4-496d-bb99-eaef21509c3d","seq":10936,"startedSeq":10936,"endedSeq":10936,"timestamp":"1788774961Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"turn-file-change-set:turn-files-6d9dc7425ba14d47cfb01f872ce4ba5d","kind":"fileChangeSet","status":"partial","sessionId":"68e1f968-54b4-496d-bb99-eaef21509c3d","seq":10937,"startedSeq":10937,"endedSeq":10937,"timestamp":"1788774961Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","t